<title>AUSTRALIA: Australia sets A$150 mln indexed bond tender.</title>
<headline>Australia sets A$150 mln indexed bond tender.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1997-05-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Australian Treasury said on Thursday it will offer A$150 million of 4.0 percent August 2020 indexed bonds at a tender on Friday.</p>
<p>The nominal value of principal is A$101.22.</p>
<p>Bids are due at 12.45 p.m. (0245 GMT) and the result will be announced at 2.00 p.m. (0400 GMT).</p>
<p>Settlement date is May 6.</p>
<p>-- Sydney newsroom 61-2 9373-1800</p>
</text>
